# Input

```scss
.ownership{
value:fn(1px,2px);
after-ordinary:1;
value:fn(1px,2px,/* ordinary close */);
after-ordinary-comment:2;
@include mix(1px,2px);
after-include:3;
@include mix(1px,2px,/* include close */);
after-include-comment:4;
@include mix($args... // spread close
);
after-spread:5;
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
.ownership {
	value: fn(1px, 2px);
	after-ordinary: 1;
	value: fn(1px, 2px /* ordinary close */);
	after-ordinary-comment: 2;
	@include mix(1px, 2px);
	after-include: 3;
	@include mix(1px, 2px /* include close */);
	after-include-comment: 4;
	@include mix(
		$args... // spread close
	);
	after-spread: 5;
}

```
